A recommended retained level-2 prefix receives a separate **event-local continuation cap of 80 JVP vectors**. The lower-level guard must refuse prospective JVP 81 before operator invocation, including atomic denial of an over-budget batch.

`S_total` remains the complete prefix-plus-continuation economics ledger but is not an admission authority. Budget exhaustion is a charged policy abstention with no endpoint or admissibility label; actual operator/invariant errors remain hard shadow failures. Recommendation and continuation outcome are separate so the frozen prefix witness cannot drift.

